OEM-macOS
=========

This project builds on and redistributes work by others. Their licences and attributions are
kept here, as the brief requires.

reims-vgpu
----------
https://github.com/steelbrain/reims-vgpu
Licence: GPL-2.0-or-later
Pinned commit: 818868564e31f9023c074f73840de97542592c91

OEM-macOS does not modify reims-vgpu. It builds it, installs it, and drives it through
`reims-ctl`. The library, the QEMU fork (`vendor/qemu`, from
https://github.com/steelbrain/qemu-reims-vgpu) and `reims-ctl` are used as upstream ships them.

QEMU
----
https://www.qemu.org/
Licence: GPL-2.0
The QEMU fork reims-vgpu builds from carries the `reims-graphics-pci` device.

Apple
-----
macOS is Apple's. OEM-macOS does not redistribute any Apple installation files. The installer
downloads the recovery image from Apple's own servers and verifies it against the chunklist
Apple serves, which is what `reims-ctl` does. Anyone running macOS under this project is bound
by Apple's licence, including its restrictions on virtualisation.
